    "title": "Braintree man charged with child sexual assault, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Madison Lucchesi ,\n3 hours ago John Donovan, 43, is charged with two counts of indecent assault and battery on a child under 14, according to Abington police.\nLess than a minute to read\nA Braintree man has been charged with sexually assaulting a child under 14, police said.\nJohn Donovan, 43, is charged with two counts of indecent assault and battery on a child under 14 and one count of open and gross lewdness, according to Abington police .\nDonovan was arrested without incident on July 31 after an investigation into a 2021 incident, the department said.\nAttorney information for Donovan was not publicly available Wednesday night.\nSign up for the Today newsletter Get everything you need to know to start your day, delivered right to your inbox every morning.",
    "summary": "2 hours ago John Donovan, 43, is charged with two counts of indecent assault and battery on a child under 14, according to Abington police. Less than a minute to read A Braintree man has been charged with sexually assaulting a child under 14, police said. John Donovan, 43, is charged with two counts of indecent assault and battery on a child under 14 and one count of open and gross lewdness, according to Abington police . Attorney information for Donovan was not publicly available Wednesday night.",
